// Integer Ceiling Division Formula

ceil(a / b) = (a + b - 1) / b                         

// Reason why just ceil(a / b) does not work is it first does integer divison a / b then ceil it. 
Eg : ceil(9 / 5) is not 2 but 1 because it first does 9 / 5 which is 1 then ceil(1) = 1.
                                                      
                                                      
